  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w23.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決戦前の祭りは、名前ごと変わっていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年の「再建祭」の幟に、新しい布が重ね縫いされている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——「新作祭」と変わっていた。理由を聞くと、商店会は胸を張った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.001d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.001d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年は、再建するものが無いからね!」健やかな理屈だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの品書きも、新作づくしだった。新作大福は、中身が日替わり。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日は普通のこしあん。それが一番の変化球だという。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "試し打ちの新作花火。夜店のくじは「景品も新作、中身は誰も知らない」"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "広場の隅の掲示に、足が止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「新作劇、旗揚げ公演——リバイバル一座改め、一番星一座」座長さんの一座だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼らは、滅亡ショーの出演を降りたのだ。あの楽屋の縁が、こんな旗になって返ってきた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社も、物量で来ていた。滅亡ショーの宣伝が、壁を覆う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その貼り紙の余白に、子どもの落書きが増えていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "兎の耳の絵と、下手な字。「けっしょう みにいく」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……物量は、落書き一つに負けることがある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の席は、前売りをしないことにした。当日、並んだ人から。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "興行の正面勝負に、予約の貯金は持ち込まない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "発表の日から、剣士さんが列の先頭を下見している。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「当日いちばん、は、わしの新作じゃ」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——祭りの帰り道、見てしまった。会社の練習場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柵の向こうで、決勝の相手が調整をしていた。歴代王者の、再現体たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "型は完璧で、荘厳だった。砂の鳴る音まで美しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あれが、四百年の頂点。強い。文句なしに、強い。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣で、うちの仲間の一人が、足を止めた。何も、言わない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "砂を掴むときの形に、拳がゆっくり閉じていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年を生きた者の、何かを知っている沈黙だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞かなかった。聞くのは、あの人の口が開く夜でいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.line.007e",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w23.line.007e",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——ぞくりの正体だけは、分かった。怖さではない、怒りだ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w23.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
